 structural: once the browser cannot start, repeating the same launch for every
 store/query wastes minutes. Page navigation timeouts must NOT open this circuit.
+
+Half-open / single-flight (Phase 2):
+  CLOSED   (HEALTHY)   ÔåÆ allow() True; normal operation
+  OPEN     (UNAVAILABLE) ÔåÆ allow() False; fail-fast
+  cooldown elapsed     ÔåÆ HALF_OPEN (DEGRADED); allow() still False
+  claim_trial()        ÔåÆ returns TrialToken for exactly ONE caller; others get None
+  non-holders          ÔåÆ fail-fast (do not wait for probe)
+  complete_trial(success=True)  ÔåÆ CLOSED
+  complete_trial(success=False) ÔåÆ OPEN + new cooldown
+  trial TTL expired    ÔåÆ auto-reopen (probe crash/cancel cannot leave HALF_OPEN forever)
